y-id "q-60185" :question/problem "Jason has apples and peaches in his kitchen. The ratio of the number of apples to the total number of fruits Jason has is $6:7.$ If Jason has $30$ apples, how many peaches does he have?" :question/worked-solution "We start with the ratio $6:7$ and write it as a fraction:\n\n$$\n\\frac{6}{7}\n$$\n\nIn this fraction, the numerator represents the number of apples and the denominator represents the total number of fruits.\n\nWe can make a numerator of $30$ by multiplying the numerator and denominator by $5:$\n\n$$\n\\frac{6\\times 5}{7\\times 5}=\\frac{30}{35}\n$$\n\nTherefore, Jason has $35$ fruits in total. So, the number of peaches Jason has is\n\n$$\n35-30=5.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-60185/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0e44aa33-0aca-5cb2-8c89-6391240beed8"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-60185"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-60139/selection/98b3dba682900da184b39a71cd54acfbad77325cb9c895968794bd8e0854ddd0" :answer/id #uuid "0d079b28-a9ad-5ccf-a0f0-87b0e136d217" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "58" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-60139/selection/0b264a929df91f183c31537acf560edd2114ab983879cbe61ea3aed58b55bda9" :answer/id #uuid "193f33da-d526-5993-9fe9-e23464e059c3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "55" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-60139/selection/728ecd05f971a253a3c26dbe75d9e0a7cfee71804ca75ebb83455b35d611b45b" :answer/id #uuid "ba8a9a24-45ca-59cf-b597-39151a7111ff" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "66" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-60139/selection/4f1ffa38d73b18554a47d8d9cea1139f02bb33ce8900fc955ea927ce75c224e3" :answer/id #uuid "97b61f14-3872-523d-9ba2-0c30474e8dde" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "62" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-60139/selection/0086db6077a62a5e2d9c771f7cdf57bea92b1de496b4d9b1d9c50dc1e5b589